ShareVaultTreasuryTest
├── given moveToVenue
│   ├── when the caller is not the operator
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when the destination is not allowlisted
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when the amount is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when the amount is above the per call cap
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when the amount is above the remaining per epoch cap
│   │   ├── it should revert
│   │   └── given the next epoch has started
│   │       └── it should allow moving again
│   ├── when the amount is above the idle assets
│   │   └── it should revert and leave reserved and pending assets untouched
│   └── when the amount is within every limit
│       └── it should send the USDC and shrink the ledger
├── given acknowledgeReturn
│   ├── when the caller is not the operator
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when the amount is above the surplus
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when the amount is backed by returned USDC
│       └── it should bring it into the ledger
└── given sweepSurplus
    ├── when the caller is not the owner
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when there is no surplus
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when USDC sits outside the ledger
        └── it should move exactly the surplus and nothing from the ledger
